### 2.2 Structures and processes
The pharmacovigilance system master file is a legal requirement in Egypt. This guidance concerns
the requirements for the pharmacovigilance system master file and is applicable for any
pharmaceutical product authorized in Egypt. The required content and management of the

pharmacovigilance system master file applies irrespective of the organizational structure of a
marketing authorization holder, including any subcontracting or delegation of activities, or their
location. Irrespective of the location of other activities, the qualified person for pharmacovigilance
(QPPV ‘s) residence, the location at which he/she carries out his/her tasks. location of other activities, the qualified person for pharmacovigilance
(QPPV ‘s) residence, the location at which he/she carries out his/her tasks.

The content of the pharmacovigilance system master file shall reflect global availability of safety
information for pharmaceutical products authorized in Egypt, with information on the
pharmacovigilance system not just confined to local or regional activities.[EDA Document: Guideline_on_Good_Pharmacovigilance_Practice_Egypt_2026.md]

