#### 3.2.10 Quality management of pharmacovigilance inspection process
Quality of the pharmacovigilance inspection process is managed by EDA and covered by their
pharmacovigilance systems and associated quality systems, meaning that the process is also
subject to audit. Guidance on establishment and maintenance of a quality assured
pharmacovigilance system is provided in chapter 1.[EDA Document: Guideline_on_Good_Pharmacovigilance_Practice_Egypt_2026.md]

