#### 5.2.5 Detailed description of each part of the risk management plan
The description of the parts and modules of an RMP provide guidance on the main topics which
shall be covered within each specific area. However, some sections may not be relevant to all
pharmaceutical products and there may be additional topics which need to be included but are not
mentioned. The RMP is part of the scientific dossier of a product and as such shall be scientifically
based and not be promotional.[EDA Document: Guideline_on_Good_Pharmacovigilance_Practice_Egypt_2026.md]

