#### 5.3.4 Justification for not submitting RMP
The justification for not submitting a RMP shall include the following, with attached reference
documents used in preparing such data:
-Clear statement that the innovator (patent-holder) has no RMP, with evidence from
reference countries on that.
- Table reflecting the updated summary of safety concerns.
- Table reflecting the proposed routine risk minimization activities, and how such routine
activities will be sufficient to manage the product safety concerns.
- The proposed SmPC of your product shall be submitted.
Attach all reference documents used to prepare the justification
