### 6.2 Structures and processes
The structures and the processes of Individual Case Safety Report collection, management, and
submission in Egypt have to be implemented following the Good Pharmacovigilance Practice.
These multiple items that shall be considered in implementation such as: ICSR collection, ICSR
validation, ICSR follow-up, data management, quality management, other observations and
finally, the submission of ICSR to EDA.

