9.2.4.2. Substantial amendments to the study protocol
The study protocol shall be amended and updated as needed throughout the course of the study.
Any substantial amendments to the protocol after the study start shall be documented in the
protocol in a traceable and auditable way including the dates of the changes. If changes to
the protocol lead to the study being considered an interventional clinical trial, EDA shall be
informed immediately and the study shall subsequently be conducted in accordance with the
National Rules Governing Clinical Trials by EDA.[EDA Document: Guideline_on_Good_Pharmacovigilance_Practice_Egypt_2026.md]

