#### 10.2.5 Means of safety communication
Communication tools and channels have become more numerous and varied over time, offering
the public more information than was previously possible. Relevant communication tools and
channels shall be considered when issuing a safety communication in order to reach the target
audiences and meet their growing expectations. Different communication tools and channels are
discussed below in 10.2.5.1. to 10.2.5.9.[EDA Document: Guideline_on_Good_Pharmacovigilance_Practice_Egypt_2026.md]

