#### 10.2.5.10 Other means of communication
In addition to those discussed above, there are other tools and channels such as publications in
scientific journals and journals of professional bodies.
Some tools and channels may be used in the context of risk management; in addition to the product
information, other communication tools can be used to disseminate information about the product.
These are considered as additional risk minimization measures and may include patient alert cards
or educational materials. These are outside the scope of this chapter and are described in more
detail in chapter 12.[EDA Document: Guideline_on_Good_Pharmacovigilance_Practice_Egypt_2026.md]

