### 13.2 Structures and processes
#### 13.2.1 Risk management system
As a general principle, any post-authorization update to the RMP for a reference product shall be
similarly applied to the relevant biosimilar and related products, and vice-versa, unless justified,
all parts of a RMP – Integrated RMP- are required for a biosimilar, with the exception of RMP
part II, module SI “Epidemiology of the target population”.[EDA Document: Guideline_on_Good_Pharmacovigilance_Practice_Egypt_2026.md]

