## RAG Metadata and Chunking Guidance
### Recommended Chunking Strategy

- Split primarily on chapter and subchapter headings.
- Keep definitions, responsibilities, timelines, submission requirements, and operational steps as coherent chunks.
- Keep each template, flowchart description, abbreviation group, and regulatory obligation in a separate retrievable unit.
- Include parent chapter context in every chunk.
- Preserve jurisdiction, regulatory authority, regulated entity, product type, reporting interval, and effective date as metadata.[EDA Document: Guideline_on_Good_Pharmacovigilance_Practice_Egypt_2026.md]

