## 7. Timing, Redosing, and Duration
### 7.1 Patient Already Receiving Antimicrobials

- If the therapeutic antimicrobial is appropriate for surgical prophylaxis, an extra dose within 60 minutes before incision is sufficient.
- If the therapeutic antimicrobial is not appropriate for the planned procedure, use the recommended prophylactic regimen for that procedure.[EDA Document: National Guidance for Antimicrobial Prophylaxis in Surgery — RAG Knowledge Base.md]

