### 9.4 Neonatal Procedures Listed as Not Requiring Preoperative Prophylaxis

The source lists the following procedures as not requiring preoperative prophylaxis:
- Central venous catheter placement, including CVC, Broviac, or port.
- Bronchoscopy.
- Circumcision.
- Inguinal hernia repair.
- Neonatal testicular torsion surgery.
- Ovarian cyst surgery.
- Gastroschisis or omphalocele surgery.

