  - Neonates and pediatrics: 30 mg/kg per dose.
  - Age 7 days or younger: every 12 hours.
  - Age above 7 days: every 8 hours.
  - Closed-sternum cardiac surgery: discontinue 48 hours after surgery end time.
  - Open-sternum cardiac surgery: discontinue 24 hours after sternal closure.[EDA Document: National Guidance for Antimicrobial Prophylaxis in Surgery — RAG Knowledge Base.md]

