### 10.13 Piperacillin–Tazobactam

- **Adult dose**: 3.375 g.
- **Infant dose, age 2–9 months**: 80 mg/kg of the piperacillin component.
- **Child dose, above 9 months and up to 40 kg**: 100 mg/kg of the piperacillin component.
- **Redosing interval**: 2 hours.
- **If continued after surgery**: 3.375 g every 8 hours by extended infusion, up to 2 doses. Type III fracture with standing-water contamination may require antibiotics for 48 hours after wound closure.[EDA Document: National Guidance for Antimicrobial Prophylaxis in Surgery — RAG Knowledge Base.md]

