# The Egyptian Non-Prescription Medicinal Products (OTC) List — RAG Knowledge Base

**Document Type**: Regulatory Medicinal-Product Classification List / RAG Knowledge Base
**Issuing Body**: Central Administration of Pharmaceutical Care
**Guideline**: The Egyptian Non-prescription Medicinal Products (OTC) List
**Code**: EDREX:GL.CAP.Care.007
**Version / Year**: Version 8 / 2024
**Source Sections**: Approved Active Ingredients’ List (May 2021); Approved Drug Products by Trade Names through July 2024
**Scope**: Non-prescription medicinal products, approved active ingredients, dosage forms/routes, notes, and approved pack limits
**Optimization**: Semantic chunking, explicit product metadata, labeled records, no HTML tables

**Metadata Tags**: OTC, Non-Prescription, POM, Active Ingredient, Generic Name, Trade Name, Dosage Form, Route, Pack Limit, Age Restriction, Pregnancy, Drowsiness, Renal Function, Labeling, Egypt, EDA

