## 3. Record Interpretation and RAG Metadata
### 3.1 Active-Ingredient Record Fields

- `record_type`: Approved Active Ingredient
- `generic_name`: Generic or active-ingredient name
- `dosage_form_or_route`: Oral, topical, nasal, ophthalmic, rectal, mouth wash, spray, gel, or other source wording
- `notes`: Age restrictions, labeling requirements, contraindications, warnings, supervision requirements, or formulation-specific conditions
- `source_section`: Approved Active Ingredients’ List — May 2021[EDA Document: The Egyptian Non-Prescription Medicinal Products (OTC) List — RAG Knowledge Base.md]

